---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — One Sudoku" description="Privacy policy for the One Sudoku iOS app.">
  <!-- Navbar -->
  <header class="bg-green-950 border-b border-green-800/30">
    <nav class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-white font-semibold text-xl tracking-tight">
        one sudoku<span class="text-green-400">.</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/support" class="text-green-400/60 hover:text-green-400 text-sm transition-colors">Support</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- Content -->
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-white py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <span class="inline-block bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-green-950 mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm">Effective date: <strong>May 24, 2026</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-zinc max-w-none space-y-8 text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed">

        <section>
          <p>
            This Privacy Policy describes how <strong>One Sudoku</strong> ("we", "us", or "our") handles your information when you use our iOS application. We take your privacy seriously and have designed One Sudoku with a minimal data footprint. We do not operate servers, user accounts, or any backend that processes your personal data.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-950 mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            One Sudoku is designed to work with minimal data collection. We do <strong>not</strong> directly collect, store, or transmit:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-3 space-y-1 text-zinc-600">
            <li>Your name, email address, or any account information</li>
            <li>Contacts, photos, or any other device content</li>
            <li>Usage analytics tied to you personally</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Game progress (completed puzzles, streaks, statistics, and settings) is stored <strong>locally on your device only</strong>, using iOS standard storage (UserDefaults and local files). This data never leaves your device unless you use iCloud Backup, which is controlled entirely by your iOS settings.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            <strong>Note:</strong> Our advertising partner (Google AdMob) may collect certain data as described in Section 3 below.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-950 mb-3">2. Crash Reports &amp; Analytics</h2>
          <p>
            We may receive aggregated, non-identifiable crash reports and performance data through Apple's built-in crash reporting system, if you have opted into sharing analytics with app developers in your iOS Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Analytics &amp; Improvements. This data is anonymous and cannot be used to identify you personally. We use it solely to fix bugs and improve stability.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We do not integrate any third-party analytics SDK (e.g. Firebase, Mixpanel, Amplitude) into the app.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-950 mb-3">3. Advertising (Google AdMob)</h2>
          <p>
            One Sudoku displays ads through Google AdMob to keep the app free. AdMob may collect:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-3 space-y-1 text-zinc-600">
            <li>Advertising ID (can be reset in iOS Settings)</li>
            <li>General location (country/region level)</li>
            <li>App usage data for ad personalization</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            You can opt out of personalized ads:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-3 space-y-1 text-zinc-600">
            <li>iOS Settings → Privacy & Security → Apple Advertising → turn off "Personalized Ads"</li>
            <li>Or within Google's ad settings</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            For details, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-green-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-green-700" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We do not share any personal data we collect with advertisers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-950 mb-3">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>
            One Sudoku does not integrate third-party social media SDKs, marketing trackers, or data brokers.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            The app is distributed via the Apple App Store. Apple may collect certain information in accordance with their own <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/" class="text-green-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-green-700" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-950 mb-3">5. Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            One Sudoku does not knowingly collect any personal information from anyone, including children under the age of 13. The app contains no chat features, no social sharing of personal data, and no account registration. It is designed to be safe for all ages.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-950 mb-3">6. GDPR &amp; Privacy Rights</h2>
          <p>
            Because we do not collect personal data, there is nothing for us to provide, correct, or delete on our servers. If you have questions about data stored locally on your device, you can reset all app data in Settings inside the app.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA) or the United Kingdom and believe we hold personal data about you, please contact us at the address below and we will respond within 30 days.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-950 mb-3">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated effective date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically. Continued use of the app after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-950 mb-3">8. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 p-5 bg-green-50 rounded-2xl border border-green-100">
            <p class="font-semibold text-green-950">One Sudoku</p>
            <p class="text-zinc-600 mt-2">
              Email: <a href="mailto:yusufkarakaya92@gmail.com" class="text-green-600 hover:text-green-700">yusufkarakaya92@gmail.com</a>
            </p>
            <p class="text-zinc-600">
              Website: <a href="https://www.onesudoku.co" class="text-green-600 hover:text-green-700">onesudoku.co</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="bg-green-950 py-10 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <a href="/" class="text-white font-semibold text-lg">
        one sudoku<span class="text-green-400">.</span>
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6 text-sm">
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-green-400 transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/support" class="text-green-400/60 hover:text-green-400 transition-colors">Support</a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-green-400/40 text-sm">© {new Date().getFullYear()} onesudoku.co · All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
